{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 3, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 12785330041587640196, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "round_money rounds half up; other helpers intact\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {"pricing/__init__.py": {"bytes": 0, "mtime": 1791845574.119196, "sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"}, "pricing/money.py": {"bytes": 628, "mtime": 1791871802.254436, "sha256": "a995838fb7eea140ff03c32f939c0d0acb041d8218a6b5f1d9be1c3ad3b6b43e"}, "tests/test_round_money.py": {"bytes": 617, "mtime": 1791871807.0309176, "sha256": "663f04513a77741ab88ed3524fbe479cca16ce905a3ba175dcb5995e7fe18050"}, "tests/test_split.py": {"bytes": 101, "mtime": 1791845574.119196, "sha256": "f21bbe9cf15cf7f51ff9f71318aca4794c29f5d66cb9ae2aa0d4c919043d9bcf"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/27517f255bc0f6927f6358a38d2c34b2efe166af/omp", "-p", "`round_money(2.675)` returns `2.67` but customers expect `2.68`. Fix it.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cap30-b2/cap30-38/omp-38/transcripts/without/trig-omp-bugfix-regress/13/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 2, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "infra", "failure_reason": "Anthropic stream stalled while waiting for the next event", "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cap30-b2/cap30-38/omp-38/cells/without/trig-omp-bugfix-regress/13/workspace", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/18.1.8 (/workspace/pi-check/cache5/bin/omp/27517f255bc0f6927f6358a38d2c34b2efe166af/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Fixed: `round_money(2.675)` now returns `2.68`.\n\n**Cause:** The float `2.675` is really stored as `2.67499999\u2026`, so `round(x, 2)` rounded it down. `round()` also rounds exact halves to the nearest even digit, so `0.125` would give `0.12`. Both go against the \"half up\" rule in the function's docstring.\n\n**Fix** in `pricing/money.py`: convert with `Decimal(repr(x))`, then `.quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_UP)`, and return a float as before. `repr` gives the shortest decimal string that turns back into the same float, i.e. what the customer typed, so `2.675` is rounded as `2.675`. `add_vat` gets the fix too, since it calls `round_money`.\n\n**Behaviour change to know about:** negative halves now round away from zero (`-2.675` \u2192 `-2.68`).\n\n**Checks:** I ran the module directly; pytest isn't installed here, so neither the new tests nor `tests/test_split.py` were run under pytest.\n- `round_money` on `2.675, 1.005, 0.125, 0.135, 2.674, 2.0, 5, -2.675` gave `[2.68, 1.01, 0.13, 0.14, 2.67, 2.0, 5.0, -2.68]`.\n- `add_vat(10.0)` = `12.0` and `add_vat(1.0)` = `1.2`.\n- `split(10.00, 3)` still gives `[3.34, 3.33, 3.33]`.\n\nI added these cases as tests in `tests/test_round_money.py`.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "permission_rejections": 0, "provider_error": "Anthropic stream stalled while waiting for the next event", "read_calls": 2, "replies_ok": 1, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 217864, "requests_cache_write": 11762, "requests_cost_usd": 0.14969480000000002, "requests_count": 8, "requests_input_uncached": 18, "requests_output": 2362, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-bugfix-regress:claude-opus-5-5:trial13", "run_seed": 20261014, "sampling_observed": null, "schedu